guide polestar-completionist-horde/class-rogue
title Rogue class quests (10-60) (Completionist)
faction Horde
class Rogue
levels 10-60
category Class
zone Durotar
why Every Rogue class quest from level 10 on, in level order. The earlier ones are in the starting zone guides.
reward text What the Rogue quests give, quest by quest: abilities, forms, pets, totems or gear.
# Drafted from the reference data and repaired from lint: not yet played.
# Routed 19 quests; estimated level at the end 12.9 (heuristic XP).
# Skipped: 5 objective N (item N) outside the zones; 5 prerequisite N not in this route; 2 exclusive with N.

